{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55260","headline":"宫词（第九十首） · 和凝","name":"宫词（第九十首）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边藩开宴贺休征，细仗初排舜日明。\n坐定两重呈百戏，乐臣低折贺昇平。\n（《全五代诗》卷十一。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七三五录此诗缺一字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}